=== Book ===

Inside you find various pages seemingly bookmarked by having their corners folded inwards.

The inside of the front cover has a disclosure from the local library, as well as a list of names under “Rentals.”

<b>Mildred Crowell</b> is listed, and the book seems to be past due.

-> END